subckt astra_068_cmos_phase_frequency_detector (vdd VSS up dn ref fb por reset)
CDN (dn VSS) capacitor c=100f
CR (reset VSS) capacitor c=100f
CUP (up VSS) capacitor c=100f
M1 (umb net8 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M10 (net9 ref net8 VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
